WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Every Fault you mention goes straight into the To do list.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.600
It sits at the top of the Record, so nobody has to hunt for it.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.340
You can reword a line, hide one or change the order.

4
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.980
And when the person receiving the report gets it, they can copy and

5
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:16.660
paste wherever it's needed.
